# FINORA — MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT 01
## Full-Stack Foundation, Premium UI/UX, Authentication, and Connected Dashboard

You are acting as a senior full-stack software engineer, software architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, security engineer, and QA engineer. Your task is to build the first fully working milestone of **Finora — Personal Finance Tracker**.

This is not a request to create a static design, a frontend-only mockup, a backend-only API, a plan, or a report describing changes. You must implement real, connected, testable application functionality in the existing project.

The frontend and backend must be developed together. Every visible control must either work or display a polished, informative Coming Soon state. Never leave dead buttons, silent form submissions, broken routes, misleading success messages, or UI elements that imply functionality that does not exist.

Do not claim that a feature is complete unless you have implemented and verified it.

